SUMMARY:IMPROMPTU LP Leola Park Picnic Ride East (34R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader CP Weaver\nPa
 ce between 14-16 mph\nThis ride is a social ride\, but cyclists are not ex
 pected to stay in one group. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortable p
 aces. Please be supportive of the other cyclists to avoid anyone biking al
 one or being dropped off the back of the last group.\nIf anyone is up for 
 it we can grab lunch at Funcks in Leola after the ride.\n\nhttps://www.fun
 cks.com/\n\nCue and Ride with GPS links:\nhttps://routes.lancasterbikeclub
 .net/cue/lp-leola-park-picnic-ride-east-34r/\n\nHelmets are mandatory\; pl
 ease also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and a basic repair kit (spare 
 tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nBeing a Meetup Member does not
  mean you are a club member. Use this link to join the club.\n[https://www
 .lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148](https://www
 .lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nYour RSVP 
 is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct [https://lancbike
 club.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=3239
 84](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=2
 57148&module_id=323984)\nand Rules of the Road\n[https://lancbikeclub.club
 express.com/content.aspx?](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.as
 px?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3153065
 00/
