 useum.\n\nShow & Go (please bring a cue if you are not familiar with the r
 oute).\nNo Leader (means that this ride will not be cancelled due to weath
 er).\n\nHelmets are mandatory\; No ear buds or audible music playing devic
 es. Please bring water\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\
 , pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waive
 r\, we encourage LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ri
 de. RSVP also allows us to contact you after the ride if needed. If you do
