SUMMARY:Impromptu: CV Churchtown ACS (18F)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nThursday Evening Road Rid
 e starting from Conestoga Valley HS. Join me as we preview a TdRR ride.\n\
 nAnticipated Average Pace: 11-12 mph\n\nRide leader: Jon Hartung\nSweep: V
 olunteer to sweep\n\nRoute:\n[https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/cv-
 cvhs-churchtown-ride/](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/cv-cvhs-ch
 urchtown-ride/)\n\nThe ride leader will ride at the advertised average spe
 ed. This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the main go
 al. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group together with o
 ccasional regroupings and a sweeper may also be appointed at the start. Pl
 ease do not join this ride if you are not willing to ride with the group. 
 If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and encoura
 ged to join a faster group.\n\nIf maintaining a 11-12 mph average is beyon
 d your current ability level\, please consider joining a slower ride first
 .\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic rep
 air kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate pa
 ssing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and M
 eetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you are 
 a club member.\n\nJoin @ Lancasterbikeclub.net -Member Signup. Your RSVP i
 s your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: Code of Conduct G
 uidance if an incident occurs: Incident Actions
