SUMMARY:FreeOnFriday? Brubaker Valley 28R
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRIDE LEADER: Jan Zerfoss\
 , average pace 12-13 mph.\nCue and Ride with GPS link: [Brubaker Valley](h
 ttps://ridewithgps.com/routes/40436909)\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride T
 ogether**\n\nThis is a casual ride and the ride leader will ride at the ad
 vertised pace. Some riders may ride faster than the leader so we'll likely
  break into one or more smaller groups. We will stop to regroup periodical
 ly. Please stay with other riders in your pace group so everyone has someo
 ne to ride with and nobody is riding solo. Usually no designated sweep but
  nobody will get dropped.\n\nThere is usually - but not always - a portabl
 e toilet in the parking lot at the start location.\n\nPost-ride coffee/ref
 reshments - [Courtyard Cafe](https://www.courtyardcafeonmain.com) There is
  indoor and outdoor seating.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please 
 bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 in
 flator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we requir
 e LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on\nM
 eetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here [Member Signup](https
 ://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nYo
 ur RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: [Code of
  Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_i
 d=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an incident occurs: [Incident Ac
 tions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=25714
 8&module_id=326137)
